# Prerequisites
*.d

# Compiled Object files
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj

# Precompiled Headers
*.gch
*.pch

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Fortran module files
*.mod
*.smod

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

# —— 例外：Dependencies 下的静态库必须随仓库提交（GLFW / GLEW / assimp 均为静态链接，
#    若不提交，克隆仓库后缺少 .lib 文件将无法编译链接）——
!Dependencies/**/*.lib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# Visual Studio 相关
.vs/
Debug/
Release/
x64/
OpenGL/x64/
OpenGL/Debug/
OpenGL/Release/

# 编译产物
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.log
*.tlog
*.idb
*.recipe
*.lastbuildstate

# 用户配置文件
*.user
*.suo
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.ipch
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.vcxproj.user
DocumentLayout.json
DocumentLayout.backup.json
fileList.bin

# 其他
imgui.ini
vc140.pdb

# 手动构建输出目录
build/
OpenGL/build/

# 允许提交 .vscode（覆盖全局忽略，使 tasks.json / launch.json / c_cpp_properties.json 可随仓库共享）
!.vscode/
!.vscode/*

# Dependencies 中非编译必需的文件（项目仅用 x64 静态链接，这些保持忽略以精简仓库）
Dependencies/GLEW/bin/
Dependencies/GLEW/lib/Release/Win32/

# GLEW 静态库位于 lib/Release/x64 下；上面的 Release/ 规则会忽略该目录，
# 必须在此处（Release/ 规则之后）重新包含，否则无法提交编译所需的 .lib
!Dependencies/GLEW/lib/Release/
!Dependencies/GLEW/lib/Release/x64/